  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You fill a creature you touch with magical healing energy for the duration. Whenever the target casts a spell using a spell slot, it can immediately roll a number of its unexpended Hit Point Dice equal to the slot’s level, regaining Hit Points equal to the total plus your spellcasting ability modifier; those dice are then expended.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-r7Wi5noolf5fuZBy\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The creature rolls and spends its Hit Point Dice from its own sheet, then adds your spellcasting ability modifier (<em>Healing Energy</em>).</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
